<title>GERMANY: SOCCER-STUTTGART BEAT COTTBUS ENERGIE IN GERMAN CUP FINAL.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-STUTTGART BEAT COTTBUS ENERGIE IN GERMAN CUP FINAL.</headline>
<dateline>BERLIN 1997-06-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result of the German Cup final</p>
<p>on Saturday:</p>
<p>VfB Stuttgart 2 - Elber 18, 52</p>
<p>Cottbus Energie 0</p>
<p>Halftime 1-0. Attendance: 75,800.</p>
</text>
